{
  "schema": "prova.verification-case/1",
  "title": "Regularised partial correlation network (EBICglasso)",
  "description": "Graphical lasso network of nine continuous scores with the penalty chosen by EBIC (gamma 0.5, 100 penalties). Nestimate uses its own pure R solver. qgraph::EBICglasso() runs the glasso package at its default convergence threshold of 1e-4, which is why the tolerance is 1e-4. The third side repeats the EBIC selection by hand on glasso::glassopath() solved to 1e-10. Only non-zero edges are listed, so a difference in which edges are kept would show as missing.",
  "covers": [
    "build_network()",
    "build_glasso()"
  ],
